    "publishedAt": "2026-11-18",
    "summary": "Financial terms have yet to be disclosed, but Dano points out that Bluewater paid $568 million in the FCC's 2017 600MHz auction for 66 licenses, which include the 58 linked to the T-Mobile agreement. In 2024, Bluewater sold $27 million of its spectrum holdings to Memphis Light, Gas and Water (MLGW) for a private wireless network. Senior Editor, Light Reading Jeff Baumgartner is a Senior Editor for Light Reading and is responsible for the day-to-day news coverage and analysis of the cable and video sectors. In between his two stints at Light Reading, he led tech coverage for Multichannel News and was a regular contributor to Broadcasting + Cable.",
