    "summary": "HPE is contributing to open, diverse technologies across the stack in compute, networking and large-scale HPC and AI systems HPE and partners are already deploying next-generation AI systems with OCP contributed designs Why future AI data centers need to be open and heterogeneous AI is evolving to be more than just a workload. We are the first OEM to extend open Ethernet in rack-scale level infrastructure with scale-up switches that we are delivering through the AMD Helios™ AI Rack by HPE systems. Enterprises are already adopting these rack-scale solutions to speed up their AI initiatives. Extending decades of direct liquid cooling leadership to AI As a leader in direct liquid cooling, with more than 50 years of expertise and 300 technology patents, we are building on our innovation to support higher thermal capacity for high-powered CPUs and accelerators across our open compute and large-scale HPC & AI systems.",
