    "publishedAt": "2026-11-04",
    "summary": "COLUMBUS, Ohio —Vertiv Holdings Co. (NYSE: VRT), a global leader in critical digital infrastructure, today announced a three-year strategic agreement with Infineon Technologies AG (FSE: IFX / OTCQX: IFNNY) to deepen their long-standing collaboration and support long-term reliable access to, and supply of, critical silicon (Si) and silicon carbide (SiC) power semiconductors. The strategic agreement supports supply continuity and reliable, on-time delivery as Vertiv scales production to meet growing demand for critical digital infrastructure. Infineon’s components are manufactured globally and will be integrated into Vertiv products worldwide, supporting data center, communication network, and commercial and industrial applications. The agreement provides Vertiv with greater visibility and predictability for power semiconductor supply over the three-year term.",
