    "summary": "Despite leveling off after a peak earlier in the year, DDR5 prices are back up, with many 32GB kits selling for above $500, as you can see in our RAM price tracker . $40 off w/ promo code BFEF202 The cheapest kit we could find, and the headline deal so far, is $40 off the Patriot Viper Venom DDR5-6000 CL36 kit. If you're after slightly tighter timings, you can spring for the V-Color Mantra XSky DDR5-6000 CL30 kit, which is only $10 more expensive. This Team Group T-Force Delta RGB kit has the largest discount that we could find at 20% off its list price, though it's $20 more expensive than the Patriot Viper Venom kit.",
