    "summary": "TrendForce's latest memory industry research indicates that Chinese Cloud Service Providers (CSPs) have reduced their 2027 memory orders, putting downward pressure on the industry's price outlook. The NAND Flash market is expected to enter a downward pricing cycle as supply continues to expand, prompting TrendForce to lower its 2027 NAND Flash revenue forecast to approximately US$419.3 billion. This has led TrendForce to revise its 2027 DRAM revenue forecast downward to $1.15 trillion.",
