    "publishedAt": "2026-11-25",
    "summary": "One part of the data center process that AI has impacted significantly is power availability. Where developers build and whether there is enough power available to run them has become increasingly more difficult. Previously, the industry still had to plan for power availability – but this was nothing like today, where developers have to figure out the path to power and how far out it is. While power is the key to everything, other constraints like community permissions are also affecting AI infrastructure growth.",
